
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-constant">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`LIST_STAT_MEDIAN: number = 4`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer LIST_STAT_MEDIAN = 4;`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant LIST_STAT_MEDIAN has the value 4</p>
  <p>Calculates the median number in the list.</p>
  <p>The median is the number for which half the values are less and half are greater. For example, the median of [1,1,1,2,1000,1000,1000] is 2, while the mean is 429.3.</p>
</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Member Of</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>ListStatisticsOperation</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>

      <div class="label-stack">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`local median = ll.ListStatistics(LIST_STAT_MEDIAN, numList)`} lang="slua" /></div>
